  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "Stage 1 (syntactic) contract for model schema version 3 snapshots. Generated from the Pydantic models in backend/src/homedesign/model/schema.py; do not edit by hand. Referential, geometric, and domain rules are in docs/architecture/building-model.md §6.",
